# Formatted

```svelte
<form
  onsubmit={(e) => {
    const x = { a: 1, b: 2 };
    e.preventDefault();
    save(x);
  }}
>
  <button
    on:click={(e) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      run('save');
    }}
  >
    Go
  </button>
</form>

```
